</p> </div> </div> </div> </div>   <div class="security-834 screen breakpoint-834"> <div id="Header834" class="dropdown-header-navigation-1 dropdown-header-navigation-834"> <header class="header-1"> <div class="container-9"> <div class="content-20"> <a class="company-logo-834" href="/"> <img class="logo" src="/img/logo-taurus.svg" alt="Union"> </a> <div class="navigation-834"> <a class="buttons-button-5 buttons-button-834" href="https://app.t-dx.com/marketplace/instruments#en"> <div class="text-9 text-mdmedium">Trade</div> </a> <a class="buttons-button-5 buttons-button-834" href="https://app.t-dx.com/invest#en"> <div class="text-9 text-mdmedium">Invest</div> </a> <div class="dropdown-header-navigation-trigger-834 dropdown-header-navigation-834"> <div class="buttons-button-5 buttons-button-834 menu-trigger menu-solutions"> <div class="text-9 text-mdmedium">Solutions</div> <img class="chevron-down" src="/img/chevron-down.svg" alt="chevron-down"> </div> </div> <div class="dropdown-header-navigation-trigger-834 dropdown-header-navigation-834"> <div class="buttons-button-5 buttons-button-834 menu-trigger menu-company"> <div class="text-9 text-mdmedium">Company</div> <img class="chevron-down-1" src="/img/chevron-down.svg" alt="chevron-down"> </div> </div> <div class="dropdown-header-navigation-trigger-1"></div> </div> </div> <div class="navigation-actions"> <div class="language-selector menu-trigger"> <img src="/img/language/en.png" alt=""> <div class="language-selector-dropdown hidden"> <a href="/de/security" class="language-selector-dropdown-item"> <img src="/img/language/de.png" alt=""> </a><a href="/fr/security" class="language-selector-dropdown-item"> <img src="/img/language/fr.png" alt=""> </a> </div> </div> <a class="buttons-button-7834 buttons-button-834" href="https://app.t-dx.com/login#en"> <div class="text-padding-3 text-padding-834"> <div class="text-9 text-mdmedium">Log in</div> </div> </a> <a class="buttons-button-8834 buttons-button-834" href="https://app.t-dx.com/onboarding/start#en"> <div class="text-padding-3 text-padding-834"> <div class="text-10 text-mdmedium">Sign up</div> </div> </a> </div> </div> </header> </div> <div class="scam-alert-banner"> <strong>Scam alert:</strong> A fraudulent AI trading application named “AI App Solution”,
    claiming to be provided by Taurus SA, is attempting to defraud individuals.
<strong>Taurus has not developed this app and does not endorse it.</strong> Please always verify
    that you are using our official websites and never share personal or financial information with
    suspicious parties. Taurus’ official websites are: <a href="https://taurushq.com">https://taurushq.com</a> and <a href="https://t-dx.com">https://t-dx.com</a> </div>  <div class="blog-page-header-3"> <div class="header-section-3"> <div class="container-21 container"> <div class="content-34"> <div class="heading-and-supporting-text-9 heading-and-supporting-text"> <div class="heading-and-subheading"> <h1 class="heading-22 display-lgsemibold"> TDX Security </h1> <img class="logomark-4" src="/img/logomark.png" alt="logomark"> </div> <p class="supporting-text-10 supporting-text text-xllight"> <span class="span-12 text-xllight">TDX relies on the Taurus-PROTECT custody technology solution and Taurus’ IT infrastructure, which is securely hosted in Switzerland. Please see our</span><span class="span-13 text-xllight">&nbsp;</span><a href="https://www.taurushq.com/security/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="redirect"><span class="span-13 text-xllight">Security page</span></a><span class="span-12 text-xllight">&nbsp;</span><span class="span-12 text-xllight">for further information. You can also review our pages related to </span><a href="https://legal.taurushq.com/website-data-protection.html" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="redirect"><span class="span-14 text-lgsemibold">privacy and data protection</span>.</a> <br> <br> <span class="span-12 text-xllight">For any inquiries related to security, please contact </span><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#9deef8fee8eff4e9e4dde9fce8efe8eef5ecb3fef2f0" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="redirect"><span class="span-13 text-xllight"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="86f5e3e5f3f4eff2ffc6f2e7f3f4f3f5eef7a8e5e9eb">[email&#160;protected]</span></span>.</a> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="pricing-section-3"> <div class="container-22 container"> <div class="content-30"> <div class="heading-and-supporting-text-10 heading-and-supporting-text"> <div class="heading-and-subheading"> <div class="heading-23 display-mdmedium"> Phishing Prevention </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="container-23 container"> <div class="frame-1171274998-7 frame-1171274998"> <div class="content-30"> <div class="ture-1"> <div class="featured-icon-3"> <img class="zap-3" src="/img/zap-2@2x.png" alt="zap"> </div> <div class="content-31"> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-3"> <div class="text-20 text-xlmedium"> Phishing Attacks </div> <p class="supporting-text-9 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Phishing attacks attempt to deceive users through fake websites or documents, luring legitimate users into sharing their credentials or engaging in sensitive operations. These attacks can originate from deceptive emails or SMS messages impersonating Taurus. </p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="ture-1"> <div class="featured-icon-3"> <img class="eye-3" src="/img/eye@2x.png" alt="eye"> </div> <div class="content-31"> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-3"> <div class="text-20 text-xlmedium">Identify It</div> <p class="supporting-text-9 supporting-text text-mdlight"> Identifying phishing can be challenging, but common warning signs include a sense of urgency, unusual presentation or visual styles, incorrect origin email addresses, and suspicious URLs. </p> </div> </div> </div> <div class="ture-1"> <div class="featured-icon-3"> <img class="at-sign-3" src="/img/at-sign@2x.png" alt="at-sign"> </div> <div class="content-31"> <div class="text-and-supporting-text-3"> <div class="text-20 text-xlmedium">Report It</div> <p class="text-21 text-mdlight"> <span class="span-12 text-mdlight">If you suspect you've been targeted or have fallen victim to a phishing attack, please promptly report it to </span><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#d1a2b4b2a4a3b8a5a891a5b0a4a3a4a2b9a0ffb2bebc" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="redirect"><span class="span-13 text-mdlight"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="2d5e484e585f4459546d594c585f585e455c034e4240">[email&#160;protected]</span></a></span><span class="span-13 text-mdlight">&nbsp;</span><span class="span-12 text-mdlight">or click on “Report a phishing” below, and provide a copy of the alleged phishing message.</span> </p> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div class="frame-1171275021-1"> <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#b1c2d4d2c4c3d8c5c8f1c5d0c4c3c4c2d9c09fd2dedc" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="cta-11 redirect"> <div class="report-3 text-mdsemibold"> Report a phishing </div> <img class="arrow-right" src="/img/arrowright@2x.png" alt="ArrowRight"> </a> </div> </div> </div> <div class="image-9"></div> </div> <img class="section-divider-3" src="/img/section-divider-4.png" alt="Section divider "> <div class="content-section-4"> <div class="container-19 container"> <div class="frame-1171274998-6 frame-1171274998"> <div class="content-32"> <div class="heading-and-subheading-9 heading-and-subheading"> <div class="heading-19 display-mdmedium"> Support Scam Prevention </div> </div> <div class="rich-text-3"> <div class="content-item-3"> <div class="flex-container-i211277 text-mdlight"> <div class="text-21"> <span class="span-15 text-mdlight"> Please be cautious if you receive unsolicited phone calls or text messages from individuals claiming to represent Taurus, especially if they request personal information or actions that seem suspicious. Criminals may attempt to compromise your account or devices through these scams. Please note that Taurus staff will NEVER request the following from you: </span> </div> <ul style="list-style:unset; margin-left:1.1rem;"> <li class="span-15 text-21 text-mdlight"> Your password </li> <li class="span-15 text-21 text-mdlight"> Funds transfer to another account </li> <li class="span-15 text-21 text-mdlight"> Remote access to your computer </li> </ul> <div class="text-21"> <span class="span-15 text-mdlight">Registration of personal details on any website other than. To register personal details in a document or other website than</span><span class="span-15 text-mdlight">&nbsp;</span><a href="https://t-dx.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="redirect"><span class="text-mdlight">t-dx.com</span></a><span class="span-15 text-mdlight">.</span> </div> <div class="text-21"> <span class="span-15 text-mdlight">If you encounter a suspicious call, please report it to </span><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#c7b4a2a4b2b5aeb3be87b3a6b2b5b2b4afb6e9a4a8aa" target="_blank" class="redirect" rel="noreferrer noopener"><span class="redirect text-mdlight"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="eb988e889e99829f92ab9f8a9e999e98839ac5888486">[email&#160;protected]</span></span></a><span class="span-13 text-mdlight">&nbsp;</span><span class="span-15 text-mdlight">or click on “Report a scam” below.</span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#7605131503041f020f360217030403051e075815191b" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="cta-11 redirect"> <div class="report-3 text-mdsemibold">Report a scam</div> <img class="arrow-right" src="/img/arrowright@2x.png" alt="ArrowRight"> </a> </div> </div> <div class="image-10"></div> </div> <img class="section-divider-3" src="/img/section-divider-4.png" alt="Section divider "> <div class="content-section-4"> <div class="container-19 container"> <div class="frame-1171274998-6 frame-1171274998"> <div class="content-32"> <div class="heading-and-subheading-9 heading-and-subheading"> <div class="heading-19 display-mdmedium"> Reporting Vulnerabilities </div> </div> <div class="rich-text-3"> <div class="content-item-3"> <div class="flex-container-i211277 text-mdlight"> <div class="text-21"> <span class="span-15 text-mdlight"> We welcome reports from security researchers regarding potential vulnerabilities affecting TDX. Our vulnerability disclosure policy is the following: We will not take action against anyone who reports an issue in a responsible manner. We commit to responding to your reports promptly and providing periodic updates on our investigation and remediation activities. </span> </div> <div class="text-21"> <span class="span-15 text-mdlight">To report a vulnerability, please email your report at </span><a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#2e5d4b4d5b5c475a576e5a4f5b5c5b5d465f004d4143" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="redirect"><span class="span-13 text-mdlight"><span class="__cf_email__" data-cfemail="4635232533342f323f063227333433352e376825292b">[email&#160;protected]</span></span></a><span class="span-15 text-mdlight"> or click on “Email your report”. We encourage you to encrypt your message, using </span><a href="/taurus-security.asc" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="redirect"><span class="span-13 text-mdlight">our PGP key</span></a><span class="span-13 text-mdlight">.</span> </div> </div> </div> </div> </div> <a href="/cdn-cgi/l/email-protection#3b485e584e49524f427b4f5a4e494e48534a15585456" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener" class="cta-11 redirect"> <div class="report-3 text-mdsemibold">Email your report</div> <img class="arrow-right" src="/img/arrowright@2x.png" alt="ArrowRight"> </a> </div> </div> </div> </div> <div id="Footer834" class="section-15 section-834"> <div class="section-16 section-834"> <div class="container-32 container-834"> <div class="content-72"> <div class="heading-and-supporting-text-21 heading-and-supporting-text-834"> <p class="heading-26 display-smmedium">Subscribe to our newsletter</p> <p class="supporting-text-21 supporting-text-834 text-xllight"> Stay up to date with the latest news, announcements, and articles. </p> </div> <news-letter id="newsletter-8454705" data-id="newsletter-8454705" class="newsletter"> <div id="hubspot-form-newsletter-8454705"></div> <div class="d-flex mt-3"> <span for="check-newsletter-footer" class="form-check-label">This newsletter service is protected by reCAPTCHA and the Google <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">Terms of Service</a> apply.</span> </div> </news-letter>  </div> </div> </div> <div class="section-17 section-834"> <div class="content-74"> <div class="frame-48095726-2"> <div class="links-3 links-834"> <img class="union-15" src="/img/union-15.png" alt="Union"> <div class="links-item links-834"> <a class="footer-links-column" href="https://app.t-dx.com/marketplace/instruments#en"> <div class="text-29 text-834 text-mdmedium">Trade</div> </a> <a class="text-29 text-834 text-mdmedium" href="https://app.t-dx.com/invest#en"> Invest </a> </div> <div class="links-item links-834"> <div class="heading-21 text-smmedium">Solutions</div> <div class="footer-links"> <div class="footer-link-3"> <a class="buttons-button-19 buttons-button-834" href="/investors"> <div class="text-29 text-834 text-mdmedium"> Investors </div> </a> </div> <div class="footer-link-3"> <a class="buttons-button-19 buttons-button-834" href="/traders"> <div class="text-29 text-834 text-mdmedium"> Traders </div> </a> </div> <div class="footer-link-3"> <a class="buttons-button-19 buttons-button-834" href="/issuers"> <div class="text-29 text-834 text-mdmedium"> Issuers </div> </a> </div> <div class="footer-link-3"> <a class="buttons-button-19 buttons-button-834" href="/banks"> <div class="text-29 text-834 text-mdmedium"> Banks </div> </a> </div> </div> </div> <div class="links-item links-834"> <div class="heading-21 text-smmedium">Company</div> <div class="footer-links"> <div class="footer-link-3"> <a class="buttons-button-19 buttons-button-834" href="/about"> <div class="text-29 text-834 text-mdmedium"> About us </div> </a> </div> <div class="footer-link-3"> <a class="buttons-button-19 buttons-button-834" href="/blog"> <div class="text-29 text-834 text-mdmedium"> Blog </div> </a> </div> <div class="footer-link-3"> <a class="buttons-button-19 buttons-button-834" href="https://legal.taurushq.com"> <div class="text-29 text-834 text-mdmedium">Legal</div> </a> </div> <div class="footer-link-3"> <a class="buttons-button-19 buttons-button-834" href="/notices"> <div class="text-29 text-834 text-mdmedium"> Notices </div> </a> </div> <div class="footer-link-3"> <a class="buttons-button-19 buttons-button-834" href="/security"> <div class="text-29 text-834 text-mdmedium"> Security </div> </a> </div> </div> </div> <div class="links-item links-834 text-smmedium"> <div class="footer-links-column-10 footer-links-column"> <div class="heading-21 text-smmedium">Developers</div> </div> <a href="https://app.t-dx.com/faq#en" class="text-29 text-834 text-mdmedium"> FAQ </a> <a href="https://t-dx.statuspage.io" class="text-29 text-834 text-mdmedium"> Status </a> </div> </div> <div>  <a href="https://twitter.com/taurus_hq" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"> <img class="social-icons" src="/img/social-icon-x.png" alt="Social icon x"> </a>  <a href="https://ch.linkedin.com/company/taurus-sa" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"> <img class="social-icons" src="/img/social-icon-linkedin.png" alt="Social icon linkedin"> </a>  <a href="https://www.facebook.com/Taurushq/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"> <img class="social-icons" src="/img/social-icon-facebook.png" alt="Social icon facebook"> </a>  <a href="https://github.com/taurusgroup" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener"> <img class="social-icons" src="/img/social-icon-github.png" alt="Social icon github"> </a>  </div> </div> <div class="frame-1-2 text-xslight"> <p class="footer-text-5 footer-text-834"> © Taurus SA 2021- <span class="dynamic-year"></span> . All rights reserved. </p> <p class="footer-text-834"> This website is owned and operated by Taurus SA (Taurus), a securities firm regulated by the Swiss Financial Market Supervisory Authority (FINMA) and a member of esisuisse. TDX is an organized trading facility operated by Taurus. It is not a stock exchange. The content of this website represents advertising material and has not been submitted to nor approved by any supervisory authority. It is not directed at residents of the United States, Canada, Singapore, China or any person in any country or jurisdiction where such distribution or use would be contrary to local laws or regulations. Please consult the terms and conditions and important regulatory disclosures in the legal section, as well as the sales restrictions relating to the products or services in question for further information. <br><br>
